:sub}): 11th of 33 centre-backs.","Players in their position's top 5: 1 for {T:home:sub}, 0 for {T:away:sub}."],"impact":"The pecking order held: {T:home:sub} fielded more players at the top of their position, and it showed."}},"s9":{"fr":{"lead":"Jumeau statistique pour Eder : Almoez Ali ({TN:Qatar}, Coupe du monde 2022), similaire à 93 %. Mêmes habitudes, autre maillot.","keys":["G. Pellè ↔ Sardar Azmoun (Coupe du monde 2022, 97 %).","M. Parolo ↔ Robin Lod (Euro 2020, 95 %).","G. Buffon ↔ Thibaut Courtois (Euro 2020, 95 %)."],"impact":"Un jumeau n'est pas un clone : la similarité compare des profils par 90 minutes (tirs, passes, xT, défense…), pas le talent. Mais ça donne des idées au mercato."},"en":{"lead":"Eder's statistical twin? Almoez Ali ({TN:Qatar}, 2022 World Cup), 93% similar. Same habits, different shirt.","keys":["G. Pellè ↔ Sardar Azmoun (2022 World Cup, 97%).","M. Parolo ↔ Robin Lod (Euro 2020, 95%).","G. Buffon ↔ Thibaut Courtois (Euro 2020, 95%)."],"impact":"A twin is not a clone: similarity compares per-90 profiles (shots, passes, xT, defending…), not talent. Still, it gives transfer ideas."}}}}